    "changelog": "Initial pack. Annual audited financial reports within 180 days of fiscal year end, carrying a stated penalty of ₦3,000,000 plus ₦300,000 per day; the Annual Operating Levy of 1% of net revenue within 30 days of submitting audited accounts; annual ownership report by 1 March; 90 days' notice before share transfers exceeding 10% of capital; the Year End Questionnaire; address changes within 7 days; equipment type approval; and Consumer Code of Practice submission and publication. Licence renewal is initiated at least six months before expiry. Every date, threshold and penalty in this pack is drawn from the phase-8 research brief and has NOT been confirmed against the regulator’s primary document. The pack ships unverified: records are usable internally but excluded from generated regulatory submissions until a person verifies them (rule R10).",
